PARTIAL ALTERNATIVE: turning GLM-5.2 MTP IndexShare off avoids the need for the
PAGE-TABLE ROW half of this diff (2b), but not the DP host-sync half (2a).

    --json-model-override-args '{"index_share_for_mtp_iteration":false}'

An arm run with this override and with 2b and 04 both asserted ABSENT from the
bytecode passed 4/4, 32/32 twice and 64/64 on 2 x 8 MI355X.  So 2b is not needed in
that configuration.  2a was NOT reverted in that arm, so nothing was learned about
it -- 2a has never been tested in isolation, here or anywhere, which is the oldest
open gap in this series.

The override does NOT substitute for 01 (padded rows) or the nextn eh_proj fix.
It is nearly free only while IndexShare's consumer stays disabled under PD by
should_use_dsa_fused_topk; upstream #31477 removes that.  See the header of
draft_cuda_graph_dp_vote.diff for the full account and the status check.

